BT /F2 17 Tf 50 748 Td (Riverside Community Library FAQ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 724 Td (Frequently asked questions - page 1 of 4) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 694 Td (Q1. What are the library opening hours?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 678 Td (A: The library is open Monday through Friday from 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM and Saturday from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 664 Td (10:00 AM to 2:00 PM. It is closed on Sunday. Holiday hours may differ.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 636 Td (Q2. Where is Riverside Community Library?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 620 Td (A: It is at 100 Riverside Avenue, beside River Park in downtown Riverside.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 592 Td (Q3. Is library membership free?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 576 Td (A: Yes. Membership is free for Riverside residents.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 548 Td (Q4. How do I sign up for a library card?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 532 Td (A: Apply at the service desk with a photo ID and proof of your current address, such as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 518 Td (a recent bill or official letter.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 490 Td (Q5. Can children become library members?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 474 Td (A: Yes. A parent or guardian must register a child and provide contact information.) Tj ET
endstream
