stream
BT /F2 17 Tf 50 748 Td (Riverside Community Library FAQ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 724 Td (Frequently asked questions - page 2 of 4) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 694 Td (Q6. How many books may I borrow at once?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 678 Td (A: Members may borrow up to five books at a time.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 650 Td (Q7. How long may I keep a book?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 634 Td (A: Books are due three weeks after checkout. Check the due date given when you borrow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 620 Td (the book.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 592 Td (Q8. Can I renew a book?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 576 Td (A: A book may be renewed once for another three weeks if another member has not placed a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 562 Td (hold on it.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 534 Td (Q9. Where do I return books?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 518 Td (A: Return books at the service desk or use the book-return slot outside the main) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 504 Td (entrance.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 476 Td (Q10. What is the late fee for an overdue book?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 460 Td (A: The fee is $0.25 per overdue book per day, up to a maximum of $5.00 for each book.) Tj ET
endstream
