BT /F2 17 Tf 50 748 Td (Riverside Community Library FAQ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 724 Td (Frequently asked questions - page 3 of 4) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 694 Td (Q11. Does the library offer free Wi-Fi?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 678 Td (A: Yes. Wi-Fi is free for visitors. Ask the service desk for connection instructions.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 650 Td (Q12. Can visitors use public computers?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 634 Td (A: Yes. Public computers are available on a first-come, first-served basis. Follow the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 620 Td (sign-in instructions and staff directions.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 592 Td (Q13. How long may I use a public computer?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 576 Td (A: Members may use a computer for up to 60 minutes per day. Ask staff about an extension) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 562 Td (if no one is waiting.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 534 Td (Q14. Can I print at the library?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 518 Td (A: Black-and-white printing is available for $0.10 per page. Ask staff for help.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 490 Td (Q15. When is the community reading group?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 474 Td (A: The group meets Tuesdays from 6:00 PM to 7:00 PM. Adults and older teens are welcome.) Tj ET
