BT /F1 10 Tf 58 620 Td (A: The book club meets on the first Thursday of each month from 6:00 PM to 7:00 PM. Ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58 606 Td (staff for the current book.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 578 Td (Q18. When are educational workshops held?) Tj ET
